{"id":"n79591-1-8","stage":5,"title":"치켜들다 · 举起","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n79591-1-8-1","ko":"우산 좀 치켜들어. 그래야 내가 비를 안 맞지.","zh":"把伞往上举一点吧。这样我就不会被雨淋到了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우산","meaning":"雨伞","explanation":"우산：雨伞。","readings":[{"term":"우산","audio":"/audio/8b6f9142a49be5004b82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71103","senseId":"1","lemma":"우산","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우산","audio":"/audio/8b6f9142a49be5004b82.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"치켜들어.","meaning":"举起，提起","explanation":"치켜들다：举起，提起；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"치켜들다","audio":"/audio/16795a5ede80a3b81427.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79591","senseId":"1","lemma":"치켜들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"치켜들어","audio":"/audio/21596fa9c7bc6ea7762a.mp3"}},{"text":"그래야","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래야","audio":"/audio/cbcac572d7fdccbe8645.mp3"}},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"비를","meaning":"雨","explanation":"비：雨；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36681","senseId":"1","lemma":"비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비를","audio":"/audio/084d01a8d7b542e3231f.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"맞지.","meaning":"淋","explanation":"맞다：淋；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66232","senseId":"4","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞지","audio":"/audio/5d4235aa419751df148a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8b6f9142a49be500","term":"우산","zh":"雨伞","audio":"/audio/8b6f9142a49be5004b82.mp3","entryId":"71103","definition":"在长竿上铺上像遮盖物一样的膜，下雨时用手举着遮雨的工具。","pronunciation":["우ː산"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"16795a5ede80a3b8","term":"치켜들다","zh":"举起，提起","audio":"/audio/16795a5ede80a3b81427.mp3","entryId":"79591","definition":"向上抬起。","pronunciation":["치켜들다"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"5e0d62698b44a434","term":"비","zh":"雨","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3","entryId":"36681","definition":"高空中形成云朵的水蒸气冷却凝聚后降落而下的水滴。","pronunciation":["비"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"淋","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66232","definition":"不避开而迎着下的雨雪等。","pronunciation":["맏따"]}],"audio":"/audio/d17fcfbfa9f22e0c7746.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n79591-1-8-2","ko":"미안, 내 키가 너보다 작아서 올려 쓰기가 힘드네.","zh":"对不起，我个子比你矮，所以很难把伞举高。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"미안,","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚，不好意思，过意不去","explanation":"미안：抱歉，愧疚，不好意思，过意不去。","readings":[{"term":"미안","audio":"/audio/ba804e5e1f4598116ffc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56257","senseId":"1","lemma":"미안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"미안","audio":"/audio/ba804e5e1f4598116ffc.mp3"}},{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3"}},{"text":"키가","meaning":"身高，身长，个子，个儿，个头儿","explanation":"키：身高，身长，个子，个儿，个头儿；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"키","audio":"/audio/e37db65fd90db469af33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20269","senseId":"1","lemma":"키","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"키가","audio":"/audio/26f2f72df3c979a9df96.mp3"}},{"text":"너보다","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너보다","audio":"/audio/c38e85a4521410d355df.mp3"}},{"text":"작아서","meaning":"小， 矮","explanation":"작다：小， 矮；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"작다","audio":"/audio/bc42f85bf5be37c92f7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69513","senseId":"1","lemma":"작다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"작아서","audio":"/audio/634e7d57e83644bfb560.mp3"}},{"text":"올려","meaning":"拉上，卷上，拉起，提起","explanation":"올리다：拉上，卷上，拉起，提起；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"올리다","audio":"/audio/ff5095d829513a79ee33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22109","senseId":"3","lemma":"올리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올려","audio":"/audio/7451fed596c0e318c0ce.mp3"}},{"text":"쓰기가","meaning":"撑，打","explanation":"쓰다：撑，打；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65173","senseId":"4","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쓰기가","audio":"/audio/cf827fe3facb3cf31931.mp3"}},{"text":"힘드네.","meaning":"难，困难，费劲，难以","explanation":"힘들다：难，困难，费劲，难以；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"힘들다","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91737","senseId":"2","lemma":"힘들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"힘드네","audio":"/audio/7bd0e0e3eecd7eec6d3a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ba804e5e1f459811","term":"미안","zh":"抱歉，愧疚，不好意思，过意不去","audio":"/audio/ba804e5e1f4598116ffc.mp3","entryId":"56257","definition":"由于做了对不起别人的事而觉得心里不舒坦、感到羞愧。","pronunciation":["미안"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"e37db65fd90db469","term":"키","zh":"身高，身长，个子，个儿，个头儿","audio":"/audio/e37db65fd90db469af33.mp3","entryId":"20269","definition":"人或动物站直时从脚到头的身体的长度。","pronunciation":["키"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"bc42f85bf5be37c9","term":"작다","zh":"小， 矮","audio":"/audio/bc42f85bf5be37c92f7c.mp3","entryId":"69513","definition":"长度、宽度、体积等少于其他或一般尺寸。","pronunciation":["작ː따"]},{"id":"ff5095d829513a79","term":"올리다","zh":"拉上，卷上，拉起，提起","audio":"/audio/ff5095d829513a79ee33.mp3","entryId":"22109","definition":"从下向上，使变高。","pronunciation":["올리다"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"撑，打","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"65173","definition":"将雨伞或阳伞等展开而举在头顶上。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]},{"id":"8eec39c3609a6c71","term":"힘들다","zh":"难，困难，费劲，难以","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3","entryId":"91737","definition":"做某事不简单或不容易。","pronunciation":["힘들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a3168e2b5a20edd087a4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.293,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=79591","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":157,"sequenceScore":3.1197,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["对不起，我个子比你矮，所以很难把伞举高。","把伞往上举一点吧。这样我就不会被雨淋到了。","吃了东西之后感觉胃里很不舒服，好像要吐了。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["把伞往上举一点吧。这样我就不会被雨淋到了。","吃了东西之后感觉胃里很不舒服，好像要吐了。","对不起，我个子比你矮，所以很难把伞举高。"],"answer":2}]}
